      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The GSB Knee joint is a nonconstrained hinge joint, which combines the advantages of the so-called condylar or surface prosthesis with those of the constrained hinge joints. This report is of observations on the results and complications in 150 arthroplasties performed over a 5 year period."},
